      I can see it now, you\u2019re a jaywalking, indoor vaping, non-recycling warrior
      of social justice. You fight for the little man and flip the bird at anyone
      who dares spill your soy milk, extra trendy, caffe-twatty.\",\"lineID\":-1,\"multiLineIDs\":[],\"isBackground\":false,\"noAnimation\":false,\"headClip\":{\"instanceID\":0},\"mouthClip\":{\"instanceID\":0},\"play2DHeadAnim\":false,\"headClip2D\":\"\",\"headLayer\":0,\"play2DMouthAnim\":false,\"mouthClip2D\":\"\",\"mouthLayer\":0,\"waitTimeOffset\":0.0}"
